<title>UK: CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE 68-1 V AUSTRALIA (362-6 DEC) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE 68-1 V AUSTRALIA (362-6 DEC) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>DERBY, England 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Derbyshire, replying to Australia's first innings 362 for six declared, were 68 for one at the close on the first day of the three-day tour match on Saturday.</p>
</text>
